421d9c80d96d7279d9626fc6bb95941031cf5` / tree `be500d1ec4268269672cf1e1bb8f6cca29e5d397` / `.github/trusted/phase2e-corrective1-baseline.json`. That identity is not the live pin and is not authorized.\n- Include Runtime Corrective 2 and Corrective 3 halt files/tests in the exact 16-path reviewed diff. Do not broaden allowed paths.\n- Trusted runtime on the exact candidate HEAD now requires a green `npm test` TAP (`474/474`, exit 0) plus `npm run test:phase2e`, with fail-closed skip/todo. Historical Corrective 1 evidence-identity failures are not ignored.\n- Preserve existing Phase 2D exact-integrity behavior. Frozen Phase 2D remains `7f196d367e39640eee9517f742b0d61424f9d4cc`.\n\n```text\nMERGE_AUTHORIZED=NO\nPHASE_2E_AUTHORIZED=NO\nLIVE_EXCHANGE_WRITE_AUTHORIZED=NO\nDEPLOYMENT_AUTHORIZED=NO\nPR7_MERGE_AUTHORIZED=NO\nPR8_MERGE_AUTHORIZED=NO\n```\n\nDo not merge this PR or PR #7 from this agent. Do not authorize runtime, testnet, mainnet, deployment, credentials, or exchange writes.\n\n## Bound identities\n\n```text\nRUNTIME_PR=7\nRUNTIME_CANDIDATE_HEAD_BOUND=704afa2dd858c52dad06aa22941d463aa5ce4d69\nRUNTIME_CANDIDATE_TREE=bda9793acd2fb8de033f65739b8c092cbdec7d9b\nFROZEN_PHASE2D_HEAD=7f196d367e39640eee9517f742b0d61424f9d4cc\nFROZEN_PHASE2D_TREE=1b0afe805269972cf7af40f7fbf0e4e6b3e35894\nBASELINE_PATH=.github/trusted/phase2e-corrective3-baseline.json\nINVALIDATED_CORRECTIVE1_HEAD=f24421d9c80d96d7279d9626fc6bb95941031cf5\nINVALIDATED_CORRECTIVE1_TREE=be500d1ec4268269672cf1e1bb8f6cca29e5d397\n```\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `node --test scripts/governance/*.test.mjs` (151 pass / 0 fail / 0 skip / 0 todo)\n- [x] Local trusted-gate classify of the exact Corrective 3 candidate: `PHASE2E_ENFORCE`\n- [x] Local trusted-gate classify of Corrective 1 HEAD `f24421d9...`: `FAIL_CLOSED`\n- [x] Local integrity evaluation against git objects at `704afa2`: `trustedBaselineIntegrityOk=true`\n- [x] Trusted runtime runner against a `704afa2` worktree: `phase2eTrustedRuntimeOk=true`, `liveExchangeWrites=false`\n- [x] Adversarial fixtures: old Corrective 1 HEAD, stale Corrective 2 HEAD, wrong tree, extra changed path, omitted Corrective 3 test file, malformed PR metadata\n- [ ] Independent governance review (do not merge from the implementation agent)","created_at":"2026-08-27T08:10:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T03:19:37Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a9aec941f7b1acde1a0a60d6c565cab42912b752","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/8/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/8/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/8/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/52445f4c2b3eb65f13ae00dbef80f07b417a7d53","head":{"label":"danny0971haha:governance/phase2e-trusted-gate","ref":"governance/phase2e-trusted-gate","sha":"52445f4c2b3eb65f13ae00dbef80f07b417a7d53","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/